  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 30089ce6c05fb8443ac124cbe58ffc7f, type: 2}
    Dialogue: "Hello! I am Jose Protasio Rizal Mercado y Alonso Realonda. Nice to
      meet you! My name is pretty long, right?\u201D "
    isLeftSide: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "I tell everyone to call me just call me Jose or Jose Rizal so they
      don\u2019t have a hard time remembering it. You can call me that too, if you\u2019d
      like!"
    isLeftSide: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "In this story of mine, you\u2019re going to be playing as me! To see
      what choices I\u2019ve made in the entirety of my life. I hope you\u2019ll
      understand and respect the choices I\u2019ve made. "
    isLeftSide: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "So buckle up! Let\u2019s take care of these guys, shall we?"
    isLeftSide: 0
